  "title": "TCP: Performance improvement for managing the OOO list",
  "description": "In some cases where a segment is missing, the OOO reassembly would\nperform as O(n^2) while it's more likely that most of the following\npackets have a greater SEQ number. Sorting the list the other way\naround is more likely to run faster and often closer to O(1).",
