        {
          "id": 2002445598,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Yeah it sounds like _application_ rather than _append_.\nI will rename this new function following your suggestion (thanks).\n\nAnother way would be to add a boolean parameter for prepend/append, but I don't think changing the function signature is appropriate (as the idea of the simple/minimalistic wireshark APIs seem to keep the function signatures simple/minimalistic).\n\nI found this performance issue while testing different things, maybe there are other places with a similar pattern, I didn't investigate this.",
