          "id": 2002462739,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Except the wmem_test.c file, there are only some calls to this function. However I would keep things how they are, by default it makes sense to parse a list from the beginning.\n\nWe just need to understand that with time related data, we're more likely to be interested with what happened just before, not after. Even with a 2-pass, it's likely to be the right point of view.",
