      "title": "TCP: Performance improvement for managing the OOO list",
      "message": "TCP: Performance improvement for managing the OOO list\n\nIn some cases where a segment is missing, the OOO reassembly would\nperform as O(n^2) while it's more likely that most of the following\npackets have a greater SEQ number. Sorting the list the other way\naround is more likely to run faster and often closer to O(1).\n",
      "author_name": "Eugene Adell",
      "author_email": "eugene.adell@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-07-16T10:01:18.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2024-07-17T12:57:45.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
